    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8869;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> are mutually perpendicular unit&nbsp;vectors.</p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></math></p>",
